    {
      "id": "c6f7d77b-ee3b-42f3-84dd-6bb7df7d0a00",
      "title": "Leia a nota curta e observe como a expressão aparece em diagnósticos sobre o bairro ou a cidade.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "a9702acd-c8a2-4c79-b042-d76702afd58a",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>el desempleo</strong> costuma aparecer quando o foco está num problema que afeta muita gente, e não num caso isolado.</p><p>Exemplo: <strong>En este distrito, el desempleo deja a muchos jóvenes sin perspectivas estables.</strong></p><p>A ideia central é de impacto coletivo e duradouro.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2cb40188-ba40-44e7-bafb-8f6de43c6cc1",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a expressão e associe o termo ao problema social que ela nomeia.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "8e6aaedf-1be6-432a-94b6-02d10e826505",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute a expressão e observe a cena.</p><p><strong>la delincuencia</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>a criminalidade</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/1cecde26d8a147edb8f44dfb0a0a4860_b04-la-delincuencia.png?Expires=1794099771&Signature=ZkskfVYV0g1dKolQGJtE~piIyEOVWnzKe77I3ghYfhNUCTyKnojoyj24sxTSeifcunwboPHFgYrel8FOCawAPeLa3xumwt4dR29zlLujB6oQ~xzqgoXa4-wk~328ZbSqwJyhzv~2AFA9usIHqskKi4vzoMmEFu2kE1ibrBIi~2kEWPfeUSBfKTa2gXoZpoXAoBnYL7YA4bbomzztlI0BmS~nEEiwWbS~mSUlnt3Aaz24JplUCrbYfD9NuAnuysCIaHPTs1KeBThX95i1XAcgWmbxC2C3qcjxEaIzdgF1ktFFehnC5wlmHxp3Sy9vK0Lyyb3-0gUBW2NwIsthuIwPKg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/c64c91c1801e48f7811d9f57baf0dd30_b04-la-delincuencia.mp3?Expires=1794099771&Signature=IR47mtPUt2vNGT1-ZJwiLEO51Xfjhi-fkTNNbBph6ElBmCdE5Cw9J5PBUq9WTE5AuyuE~Yb9C1WEkfkBwBhMOU5S7RuDJFMyRTSURKCgQIg~9xBzGhjEDxCSDC7pECJoZia-SyabsOCv7HKYhmof0N5vqh4RTmY1QhjU6OUL4xpVUHjlydvZ1631fH7mPw6qukrT7HaNX1V7wR5mnkXperWvAQAlkOxk3TEnGNmRl-YVbIZBuWbembBLbfl6K7eJKnOUz8QqcB--pqy~H4bi7tCvuE1NgehM-iVQgsUstLvw0Nvt0EuGzj6y6HlXxxrfLyETLTjcjQVG30fE-GQC6Q__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
