    {
      "id": "ce98e3bc-baac-4e04-8d18-180bf317b546",
      "title": "Leia a nota e observe que a expressão aponta para um padrão social que altera a rotina do bairro.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "ee1319f6-7108-4b04-a794-5f85741485df",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>la delincuencia</strong> ajuda a falar de roubos, ameaças ou insegurança que se repetem e mudam a vida de um bairro.</p><p>Exemplo: <strong>La delincuencia hace que muchos vecinos eviten salir de noche.</strong></p><p>O efeito aparece na convivência e no uso dos espaços públicos.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "d3b43e99-c4b7-470b-8d7e-e2d04a452114",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a expressão e acompanhe a tradução.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "8bc03aa3-b330-48e1-a528-e30aaf29bf73",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute a expressão e observe a cena.</p><p><strong>la discriminación</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>a discriminação</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/662fd520aad5447ebb96f3ffd7683c87_b06-la-discriminacion.png?Expires=1794099771&Signature=se-htBmBe-eOE-jP9ZzasXtQUForaqdHFb4ltvt7EBi-GrapW3zmUNn5dmhHSBbjHlL3yB5X1PInQfJhnhxR5~ruJjK-F~S3VshnarMAtBQNA1G5r93A5txBYYh~F~YDhW1gbXcdt5WWBVKo7K3cxVDNs7TAthkXPLLgPSAoi9DiMdC-dJkIPsWGIiXMAHWf5-6LywgOmhASeEEzaMr6PWNJeUWQJS~tDgp3BVa69l~vzv9O0O9uJLprft7YRbU-ApCeGUmRDiep92E1FkUl~9gAasqwFoCumeEARVKQJRzo-Nguf02Ma25PH6s~F1DqFv4QNiUt2iUqx2M51j27Rw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/b767a15352bd4b60a22e9ba554d176b3_b06-la-discriminacion.mp3?Expires=1794099771&Signature=ILqdtuMBNN~wbK64kxsHe6BPgvdVmDRwhCNJOUXZXStYJlpUiHGbtjlAY~60fZir71U947D4XN9sir914W4GoBD--CLNqujViOZQpe1RgbSbBVEDhJTIAykJlZSWTBd-JssOUTbuLWVM8NmXVpN2UWQ2ox8HNhY-Xl3TJVwfbUoypRCaRNtPKCzd5BSMz~XOXUkFCbNy-0EOD-xPGTcVIuKXL9pMr4ulI9u4TkKvF3d5hVx~ihuXMQMMtof5NQFucLgR2exJF6eble36AUBBhXdYXSAYYkiU1k9zoje8voGli0OTqt5Flmm1e-5KznlmbapgXc7~m3FWxf1H5e3CdQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
